Exported from `src/assets/images/team/index.ts`. Team portraits use `LookbookTeamPortrait` — B&W, grain, high-contrast CSS treatment (`editorialTreatment: true`).

## Anti-patterns

- Hardcoding Unsplash URLs for facility/space/equipment imagery
- Importing directly from `GYM PHOTOS BETA/` in components (Vite bundle path — copy to `src/assets/images/gym/` instead)
- Renaming or moving files inside `GYM PHOTOS BETA/` without updating this rule
